{
  "id": "grammar-8",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 8,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "連接詞：and、but、so、because",
  "titleEn": "Conjunctions",
  "summary": "把兩個句子接起來，表示順接、轉折、原因、結果。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文會說「但是、所以、因為、雖然、如果」，英文也有對應的連接詞。",
        "多益常考「看前後兩句的關係」選連接詞：意思相反用 but／although，原因用 because，結果用 so。",
        "還有成對出現的：both A and B（兩者都）、either A or B（二選一）、not only A but also B（不只…而且…）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "看前後兩句的關係："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "關係",
          "連接詞",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "加上、而且",
            "and",
            "I called and emailed him."
          ],
          [
            "相反、轉折",
            "but／although／however",
            "It's small, but it's nice."
          ],
          [
            "原因",
            "because／since",
            "I was late because of the rain."
          ],
          [
            "結果",
            "so",
            "It was raining, so we stayed home."
          ],
          [
            "條件",
            "if／unless",
            "If you have questions, call me."
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "because 後面接句子（because it rained），because of 後面接名詞（because of the rain）。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The hotel is small but clean.",
          "zh": "這家飯店小但乾淨。",
          "highlight": "but",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-8/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "I stayed home because I was sick.",
          "zh": "我因為生病待在家。",
          "highlight": "because",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-8/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The bus was late, so I took a taxi.",
          "zh": "公車遲到，所以我搭了計程車。",
          "highlight": "so",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-8/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Although it was raining, we played tennis.",
          "zh": "雖然在下雨，我們還是打了網球。",
          "highlight": "Although",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-8/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The flight was delayed,",
              "label": "結果的原因"
            },
            {
              "text": "so",
              "label": "所以"
            },
            {
              "text": "we missed",
              "label": "結果"
            },
            {
              "text": "the meeting.",
              "label": "受詞"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "前面是原因，後面是結果，用 so"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Although",
              "label": "雖然"
            },
            {
              "text": "the price is high,",
              "label": "前句"
            },
            {
              "text": "many people",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "buy it.",
              "label": "相反的結果"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "前後意思相反，用 although"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "Because it rained, so we stayed home.",
          "right": "Because it rained, we stayed home.",
          "why": "中文說「因為…所以…」，英文 because 和 so 只能用一個。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "I was late because the traffic.",
          "right": "I was late because of the traffic.",
          "why": "後面是名詞 the traffic，要用 because of。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "Although it was cold, but we went out.",
          "right": "Although it was cold, we went out.",
          "why": "although 和 but 只能用一個。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
